47. RETRY ARCHITECTURE
==================================================

Retries must distinguish:

TRANSIENT
vs
PERMANENT

Transient:

- timeout
- network failure
- temporary service unavailable
- temporary throttling

Permanent:

- invalid target
- removed account
- banned target
- insufficient permission
- unsupported payload
- nonexistent group
- permanently unavailable destination

Use bounded retry policies.

Never infinite-retry a permanent failure.

Never mark a job successful just because it was queued.

